        "original_id": "6b9d4e62-d6f4-5e71-8e5b-80f0c66d746c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2007 Fiesta Bowl, 2007 Orange Bowl\n- Organizations: ABC, CBS, Fox, NBC\n- Places: Dolphin Stadium, Miami Gardens, Florida\n\nFacts:\n- The 2007 Fiesta Bowl broadcast made the Fiesta Bowl the first bowl game to air on all four major U.S. television networks: ABC, CBS, Fox, and NBC.\n- The Orange Bowl became the second bowl game to air on all four major U.S. television networks on the night after the 2007 Fiesta Bowl broadcast.\n- The 2007 Orange Bowl was played on January 2, 2007.\n- The 2007 Orange Bowl was played at Dolphin Stadium in Miami Gardens, Florida.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "fa719574-d9cb-5ef8-84be-83214503e49b",
        "text": "Page: 2007 Fiesta Bowl. Sentence: With this broadcast, the Fiesta Bowl became the first bowl game to air on all the \"big four\" television networks (ABC, CBS, Fox and NBC) – the Orange Bowl became the second, the following night.\nPage: 2007 Orange Bowl. Sentence: The game was played on January 2, 2007, at Dolphin Stadium in Miami Gardens, Florida.",
